(15, 'about_us', '<p><font color=\"#000000\">Our specialization includes projects for residence, commercial, industrial. Also supply of electrical\r\n material projects of Residence, Restaurants &amp; Café, Corporate, Hospitality, Health care, Banking and\r\n it\'s all-Electrical works across United Arab Emirates. This exposure makes us familiar with all major\r\n segment from the initial days of our journey as an organization. We have adopted a unique approach\r\n towards our client that is being enriched day by day out in our practices of creating to their\r\n expectations. Behind the name smart sense there stands a dedicated team of professional from across\r\n the UAE who works together for creating milestones and maintaining standards.&nbsp;</font></p>', NULL, '2025-09-18 14:11:29'),
