-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b>6. Your Rights</b></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><b><br></b></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">You have the right to:</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">●&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Access or update your personal data</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">●&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Request deletion of your information</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">●&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">Opt out of marketing communications at any time</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">To make any of these requests, please contact us at:</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternat