ice\":101.6,\"sku\":\"ECY-C-1Cx240mm\\u00b2-Meter\",\"qty\":1000},{\"type\":\"1Cx300mm\\u00b2-Meter\",\"price\":126,\"sku\":\"ECY-C-1Cx300mm\\u00b2-Meter\",\"qty\":1000}]', '[]', '[]', 0, 4.52, 0, '0', 'percent', 'include', '0', 'flat', 12000, 1, '<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical\" style=\"margin: 1.12em 0px 1.12em 20px; padding: 0px; font-family: \"Amazon Ember\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><li style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><font color=\"#000000\">The PVC core cable H07V-K is a flexible cable with individual wires and a PVC insulating sheath, which is suitable for pipe laying in the ground area.</font></span></li><li style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><font color=\"#000000\">It is particularly suitable for applications with medium to high current loads in residential and commercial areas</font></span></li><li style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><font color=\"#000000\">The cable is robust and resistant to wear and chemical influences</font></span></li><li style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><font color=\"#000000\">Flexible design makes installation easy and allows for easy handling in dry or humid environments</font></span></li><li style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><font color=\"#000000\">Material conductor made of copper, blank.</font></span></li><li style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><font color=\"#000000\">For use in dry rooms for fixed and flexible installation in switching and distribution systems.</font></span></li></ul><p style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px;\"><font color=\"#000000\">PVC core cable H07V-K is a flexible cable with individual wires and a PVC insulating sheath, which is suitable for pipe laying in the ground area. With a cross section of 10 mm2, it is ideal for use in medium to high current applications.</font></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0em 0px 1em 1em; font-family: \"Amazon Ember\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><font color=\"#000000\">This grounding cable is suitable for use in both residential and commercial areas. The underground cable is particularly robust and resistant to wear and chemical influences.</font></span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0em 0px 1em 1em; font-family: \"Amazon Ember\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><font color=\"#000000\">The flexible design of this H07V-K cable makes installation easier and allows for easy handling. The 10mm2 wiring cable is designed for use in dry or damp environments and offers reliable performance and long durability.</font></span></p><p style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0em 0px 1em 1em; font-family: \"Amazon Ember\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><font color=\"#000000\">In summary, the H07V-K PVC core cable with flexible single cores and a PVC insulation jacket is an excellent choice for medium to high current applications requiring reliable and robust wiring.</font></span></p>', 0, NULL, '2025-09-09 17:05:09', '2025-11-11 18:33:01', 1, 1, 'Earthing Cable Y/G - Cu/PVC', 'PVC core cable H07V-K is a flexible cable with individual wires and a PVC insulating sheath, which is suitable for pipe laying in the ground area. With a cross section of 10 mm2, it is ideal ', '2025-09-09-68bffbd55fc7b.webp', 1, NULL, 0.00, 0, NULL, NULL, 'V5TOO4'),
