(253, 'admin', 2, 'Crimping Tools', 'crimping-tools-rZEmHV', 'physical', '[{\"id\":\"86\",\"position\":1}]', '86', NULL, NULL, 34, 'kg', 1, 1, NULL, '', NULL, '[{\"image_name\":\"2025-11-14-6916defa70933.webp\",\"storage\":\"public\"}]', '[]', '2025-11-14-6916defa7d9b1.webp', 'public', '', 'public', '0', NULL, 'youtube', NULL, '[]', 0, 'null', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 0, 1000, 0, '0', 'percent', 'include', '0', 'flat', 1000, 1, '<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 18px; color: rgb(15, 17, 17); padding: 0px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">This hand crimper has efficient ratcheting mechanism. Crimping is accurate and never damage the terminal,crimping is in one step.</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\"><b>Wire Crimper Design:</b> Made of high-carbon steel which is treated with black oxidation,rust and corrosion resistance and insulated rubber, and ratcheting mechanism design help you take less strength to make a good crimp. </span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">This terminal crimper has a star wheel that you can adjust the handle crimp strength by adjusting the roulette to ensure uniform crimping each time.Heavy Duty Full-Cycle ratcheting terminal crimper with labor saving system help to a easier operation.The ratcheting function allows to secure a wire connector while you can insert the wires into the crimp.</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\"><b>Emergency release device:</b>Make sure that the terminal is crimped into place so that the crimped terminal and wire are securely and securely combined. The crimping operation can be terminated and the terminal can be exited in the event of a misoperation.Pressure adjustment knob:When crimping terminals of different sizes, if the wires cannot be pressed, loosen the screws, adjust the knob, + to increase the pressure, - to reduce the pressure.</span></li><li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">The handle is made of soft rubber and designed in ergonomic lever structure, which can increase friction and help you use less effort when crimping</span></li></ul>', 0, NULL, '2025-09-20 18:54:54', '2025-11-14 14:50:08', 1, 1, 'Crimping Tools', 'Made of high-carbon steel which is treated with black oxidation,rust and corrosion resistance and insulated rubber, and ratcheting mechanism design help you take less strength to make a good ', NULL, 1, NULL, 0.00, 0, NULL, NULL, 'J7XFDG');
